  "problem": "Let $S$ be an oriented piecewise-smooth surface bounded by the closed curve $C$ with positive orientation and parametrization $r(t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,i+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,j+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,k$ for $t\\in [-1,1).$\nGiven that $F(x,y,z)=2y\\,i-2x\\,j+{e}^{z-2y}\\,k,$ evaluate the integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}\\text{curl}\\,F\\cdot \\text{d}S.\n$$",
